  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Performance powerhouse! Carve your lane and keep your momentum strong in the Nike Zoom Vomero 5. The richly layered design of these shoes blends textured textiles and sleek synthetic leather with sculpted detailing, delivering a look that’s bold, expressive, and built to move with you. The Zoom Air cushioning delivers that snappy, quick-off-the-ground feel, while the plastic side caging locks in support through every transition. Accented with a rugged rubber outsole that offers lasting traction, these shoes let you bounce from workouts to walkouts with ease. Push boundaries, stay fresh, and run your day in the Nike Zoom Vomero 5.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Textiles and synthetic leather on the upper add durability and structure.</li> <li>Layered design with sculpted detailing delivers a bold and expressive look.</li> <li>Reflective details ensure safety during low-light conditions.</li> <li>Plastic caging on the side enhances support.</li> <li>Zoom Air cushioning provides a quick-off-the-ground sensation.</li> <li>Rubber outsole offers durable traction across varied surfaces.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Black/Star Blue</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;fon